sequenceDiagram
  participant T1 as kv_sync_thread (leader)
  participant T2 as writer 2
  participant T3 as writer 3
  participant WT as WriteThread
  participant WAL as WAL on BlueFS
  participant MT as memtable
  T1->>WT: JoinBatchGroup (newest_writer_ CAS)
  Note over T1,WT: the queue was empty, so T1 becomes the leader
  T2->>WT: JoinBatchGroup and wait on state
  T3->>WT: JoinBatchGroup and wait on state
  T1->>WT: EnterAsBatchGroupLeader
  Note over WT: max_size = 1 MiB, or leader size + 128 KiB if the leader ≤ 128 KiB
  WT-->>T1: group {T1, T2, T3} if sync, disable_wal etc. are compatible
  T1->>WAL: one AddRecord for the merged batch
  T1->>WAL: Sync if any member asked for sync
  T1->>MT: insert the batches with consecutive seq
  T1->>WT: ExitAsBatchGroupLeader
  WT-->>T2: STATE_COMPLETED
  WT-->>T3: STATE_COMPLETED
